      "writtenOn": "2026-07-15T19:24:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why does this change fall back to accepting *any* VPN when we don\u0027t like the answer we get from `getInterfaceForDestination`, without checking anything about it? Could it possibly \"fall back\" to a VPN that doesn\u0027t even cover the wider internet, e.g. to one that only covers 10.1.2.0/24 or something small, and thereby interfere with connected devices even further in that case?",
      "revId": "3b334b6e9926a3dba5e227988b58df80f42f668e",
