      "writtenOn": "2026-07-15T16:11:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It seems to me that the conditions under which if4 is assigned the interface name in the code and when the comment specifies that it should be assigned don\u0027t match.\n\nOn a separate note, I would personally suggest that the fix, if related to these values not being assigned the correct value when split-route VPNs are in use, would directly modify `getInterfaceForDestination` (and `getIPv6Interface` if applicable)",
